WEBVTT

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:30.496
which they then work on during the day
before the next performance.

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:31.736
It's a spiral

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:33.336
to ever-increasing capabilities,

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:36.976
but we need to know when we seek to learn,
and when we seek to perform,

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.056
and while we want
to spend time doing both,

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.176
the more time we spend
in the learning zone,

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:42.440
the more we'll improve.

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:45.760
So how can we spend
more time in the learning zone?

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:50.216
First, we must believe and understand

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.576
that we can improve,

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:53.120
what we call a growth mindset.

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:57.096
Second, we must want
to improve at that particular skill.

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:59.056
There has to be a purpose we care about,

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.680
because it takes time and effort.